: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 생활관 징계에 의해 입사가 제한된 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학칙에 의해 징계처분을 받은 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보호자의 주소지가 구미시인 자 (단, 읍·면 지역은 신청 가능)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 휴학생 및 졸업유예자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 선발방법 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">선착순 선발</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 신청방법 : 담당자에게 <font color=\"#0900ff\">유선 연락 </font>(☏ 054-478-7270)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">6. 기타사항</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 9월 30일 오전 중에 입사 가능한 분에 한하여 신청 가능(성적 무관)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 생활관비</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 7일식 : 698,950원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 5일식 : 618,800원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 식사안함 : 310,250원</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013. 9.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></p><!--StartFragment--><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
